# Discrete color map for categorical data (5 categories, indices 0-4).
# Used with DiscreteColors = true so that an integer category value in the CSV
# maps directly to the corresponding color entry by index, with no interpolation.
#
#   Index 0 -> Red      (stars)
#   Index 1 -> Green    (nebulae)
#   Index 2 -> Blue     (galaxies)
#   Index 3 -> Orange   (clusters)
#   Index 4 -> Purple   (quasars)
#
# Format: <number_of_colors>
#         <r> <g> <b> <a>  (one line per color, values in [0, 1])
5
0.894 0.102 0.110 1.0
0.302 0.686 0.290 1.0
0.216 0.494 0.722 1.0
1.000 0.498 0.000 1.0
0.596 0.306 0.639 1.0
